+    Input structure:
+    - A full-width grey separator row splits the grid into an upper table region and a lower metadata region.
+    - The upper region contains one rectangular color table on black background, using 3 or 4 colors among blue(1), red(2), green(3), yellow(4); some interior table cells are replaced by black(0) holes.
+    - The lower region contains the same number of 1-pixel-wide grey vertical bars, each a separate 4-connected component with a distinct height.
